<blockquote class="uncited"><div>Hi, thank you  for everything you do on this free project.<br>I use a Retevis RT3S GPS, latest "Release Candidate 2 Version 2024 08 03" onboard.<br><br>I noticed that when i set Ptt Latch option in the radio menu to On it doesn't work. Ptt button operates normally. Tried also to reflash but no success, I suppose I had the same trouble with one or two previous betas, but initially it worked fine, one touch for tx on and one again for tx off...<br><br>Am I doing something wrong or is an issue?<br>I was just curious, it's not an essential feature for me.<br><br>I also noticed that the green led stopped working, I suppose it is a cold soldering issue in this case, because also in DFU mode the led doesn't blink (only red blinks).<br><br>73 and many thanks.<br>Fabio.</div></blockquote>Just tested the PTT latch on UV380 and its working fine.<p>Statistics: Posted by <a href="http://localhost/opengd77/memberlist.php?mode=viewprofile&amp;u=50">VK3KYY</a> — Wed Sep 04, 2024 10:28 am</p><hr />
]]></content>
